<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USX-U.S. Steel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USX-U.S. Steel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded USX-U.S. Steel Group to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- USX-U.S. Steel gained 3/4 to 32-1/4 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
